  /// <summary>A symbolic expression tree over +, -, *, /, ^ (power) and sin/cos/exp/log, supporting symbolic differentiation, basic algebraic simplification, and numeric evaluation. Value type wrapping a shared, immutable node tree -- copies are cheap and structural sharing across copies is always safe since nodes are never mutated after construction.</summary>
