    function ArcDiagram(const APositions: TArrayOfDouble; const AFrom: TArrayOfInt64; const ATo: TArrayOfInt64; AColor: TRgb): TRPlot; overload;
    /// <summary>Colors region polygons on one shared numeric scale.</summary>
    /// <remarks>
    /// <para>Calls the C++ method <c>datamunge::graphics::RPlot::choropleth</c>.</para>
    /// <para>Coordinates are supplied in the desired projection. Each polygon is an outer ring. Provide separate rings with the same value for disconnected parts of a region.</para>
