    /// <para>Leaves out the C++ default arguments <c>AColumns = C++ default</c> (other overloads pass them).</para>
    /// </remarks>
    /// <param name="AData">Source frame; its values are copied.</param>
    /// <exception cref="ENativeError">Kind <c>InvalidArgument</c> (C++ <c>std::invalid_argument</c>): For a missing column, or fewer than two variables.</exception>
    constructor Create(AData: TDataFrame); overload;
    /// <summary>Builds the matrix from a facade DataFrame (the overload SWIG bindings use).</summary>
    /// <remarks>
    /// <para>Calls the C++ constructor of <c>datamunge::Splom</c>.</para>
