/// <summary>Bartlett's test of equal variances for independent normal groups.</summary>
/// <remarks>
/// <para>Calls C++ <c>datamunge::stats::bartlett_test</c>.</para>
/// <para>Compares the pooled log variance with the weighted group log variances and applies Bartlett's finite-sample correction. Inputs are unchanged.</para>
/// <para><b>Example</b></para>
/// <code>
/// const auto fit = dm::stats::bartlett_test({1, 2, 4, 3, 6, 9, 12, 15, 3, 4, 5, 5}, {3, 5, 4});
