/// <para><b>References</b></para>
/// <list type="bullet">
/// <item><description>P. H. C. Eilers and B. D. Marx (1996). Flexible smoothing with B-splines and penalties. https://doi.org/10.1214/ss/1038425655</description></item>
/// <item><description>P. H. C. Eilers, I. D. Currie and M. Durban (2006). Fast and compact smoothing on large multidimensional grids. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.csda.2004.07.008</description></item>
/// </list>
/// <para>See also: <c>fit_tensor_bspline()</c>, <c>fit_pspline()</c>.</para>
